      "section_code": "thesis",
      "section_title": "Sector Synthesis & Thesis",
      "content": "The Indian Gold Jewellery Retail Sector is undergoing a major structural tailwind. The\n6% custom import duty reduction\ndrastically narrows the price gap between official channel gold and unorganized market imports, driving massive market share transfer to\norganized national chains (Tanishq, Kalyan, Senco)\n.\nWith high-margin\nstudded and diamond jewellery mix expanding past 30%\n, and companies scaling via asset-light franchise models (FOCO), organized jewellers are set for superior earnings compounding over FY27-FY28.",
      "source_locator": "gold-jewellery-q1fy27-sector-review.html#.synth"
    }
  ],
